  "description": {
   "en": "The main character, Ryouko Kamitenma, is excellent at her job as a company president, but has no sense of romance. Just as she dreams of having a drama-like love someday, a young entrepreneur named Torakawa Ginzan appears. He helps her out in a pinch and gives her sweet words, and she thinks it might be fate... but what if Ginzan's words and actions are just for a certain purpose...?"
